      "title": "春和景明前篇·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16380001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "虽然说手办不会饿也不会累，但还是感觉好辛苦啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16380002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "好了，休息结束，抓紧时间，我们再来一次！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16380003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔·小甜甜",
          "text": "啊……太多了，要受不了了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16380004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "体力跟不上，看来要好好调教才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16380005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "你们两个不要在那里讲奇怪的话了，快起来准备！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一小时后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "感觉这次动作顺畅多了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "的确进步许多。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，看来我也是蛮有天赋的嘛~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "这位同学，今天的学习成果如何，要不要老师亲，自，检，查？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔·小甜甜",
          "text": "啊，可是人好多……总觉得有些羞耻……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呵呵……这样更刺激，不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "大概她们两个碰面，场面就会变成这个样子……不要太在意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16381009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "不过她们两个跳得真好啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "兹拉——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "怎么了？音乐怎么突然停了，是坏掉了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "没有喔，是小艾里克希娅关掉的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "停一下，大家，停——下——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "艾里克希娅……干嘛突然这么严肃呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "看看你们跳的都是些什么乱七八糟，为什么不能认认真真地好好练习呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "妾身觉得这位同学已经练习得很出色了，不是么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "嗯……我也觉得大家已经跳得很好了，最后三次排练也都没有出错……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16382009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "你们……简直……\n……真是跟你们说不通。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-345",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "miku",
          "rowIds": [
